            <item lang="en-US">Unknown field type, allowed are "boolean", "tristate", "integer", "float" or "string"</item>
            <item lang="cs-CZ">Neznámý typ prvku, povoleny jsou "boolean", "tristate", "integer", "float" or "string"</item>
